  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "<p>If the initial velocity in horizontal direction of a projectile is unit vector <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;and the equation of trajectory is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>. The <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi></math> component vector of the initial velocity is _____&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p>(Take <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>)</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "5",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given here, initial velocity,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Equation of trajectory,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p>Now, differentiating the above equation,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mo>d</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>d</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mfrac><mrow><mo>d</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>d</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>x</mi><mfrac><mrow><mo>d</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>d</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>For initial <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi></math>-component of velocity</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mo>d</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>d</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>5</mn><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p></blockquote>",
